  "description": "Overview: The Adoraxe Python Web Scraper Challenge is an online individual coding competition for students interested in Python, Web Scraping, Data Extraction, and Software Development. Put your Python and web-scraping skills to the test through a technical challenge involving web analysis, data extraction, processing, and automation. Eligibility & Rules: Open only to students from Mumbai and Navi Mumbai. Individual participation only. Selenium and Playwright are strictly prohibited. Participants must submit their own solutions. Collaboration or submission of another participant's work may result in disqualification. Competition Structure: Stage 1 – Registration: Register individually to receive the challenge and participation details. Stage 2 – Web Scraping Challenge: Solve a technical challenge involving: Analysing web pages and HTML structures. Extracting relevant data. Writing Python scraping scripts. Processing extracted information. Handling edge cases. Stage 3 – Submission & Evaluation: Solutions will be evaluated based on: Accuracy and correctness. Scraping efficiency. Edge-case handling. Problem-solving approach. Successful completion of the challenge. Skills: The challenge tests your understanding of: Python · Web Scraping · HTML Parsing · HTTP Requests · Data Extraction · Automation · Regex · Data Processing · Debugging Take the Challenge: Explore. Extract. Automate. Solve. Put your Python and web-scraping skills to the test with the Adoraxe Python Web Scraper Challenge.",
