    "details": "<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<p>The Adoraxe Python Web Scraper Challenge is an online individual coding competition for students interested in Python, Web Scraping, Data Extraction, and Software Development.</p>\n<p>Put your Python and web-scraping skills to the test through a technical challenge involving web analysis, data extraction, processing, and automation.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility &amp; Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open only to students from Mumbai and Navi Mumbai.</li>\n<li>Individual participation only.</li>\n<li>Selenium and Playwright are strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li>Participants must submit their own solutions.</li>\n<li>Collaboration or submission of another participant's work may result in disqualification.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Competition Structure:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1 &ndash; Registration:</strong></p>\n<p>Register individually to receive the challenge and participation details.</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2 &ndash; Web Scraping Challenge:</strong></p>\n<p>Solve a technical challenge involving:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Analysing web pages and HTML structures.</li>\n<li>Extracting relevant data.</li>\n<li>Writing Python scraping scripts.</li>\n<li>Processing extracted information.</li>\n<li>Handling edge cases.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Stage 3 &ndash; Submission &amp; Evaluation:</strong></p>\n<p>Solutions will be evaluated based on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accuracy and correctness.</li>\n<li>Scraping efficiency.</li>\n<li>Edge-case handling.</li>\n<li>Problem-solving approach.</li>\n<li>Successful completion of the challenge.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong></p>\n<p>The challenge tests your understanding of:</p>\n<p>Python &middot; Web Scraping &middot; HTML Parsing &middot; HTTP Requests &middot; Data Extraction &middot; Automation &middot; Regex &middot; Data Processing &middot; Debugging</p>\n<p><strong>Take the Challenge:</strong></p>\n<p>Explore. Extract. Automate. Solve.</p>\n<p>Put your Python and web-scraping skills to the test with the Adoraxe Python Web Scraper Challenge.</p>",
